    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "The one who dons this garb finds their limbs light and movements fluid. Thick wool and reinforced leather provide a stout defense against the biting winds and the severing edge of a blade. It carries the weight of the high heavens, warding against the scream of the storm."
